{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-03",
  "title": "Warning Shot",
  "storyCode": "10-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7218900b6077c9eda499d1c7bf0307fa8145b7b2f2818c22e6ee0d47024027c1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gah! The lift fell over––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If it had been a little lower, m-my leg would've..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Hold on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "I mean, hold on to my construct!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "You idiot... Don't drag me down too! It's hard enough to stay afloat bringing you bunch with me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "text": "C-Captain... Thank you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Next time, be smarter about how you run so you're less of a nuisance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "text": "Watch out, Captain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "That's... an artillery shell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "No, it's far more destructive than normal artillery..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "And, it was aimed so precisely at a small area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Manfred... You've been watching us this whole time?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Bloody hell, that slimy devil!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Alright, everyone stop right here! We don't need to chase after those Sarkaz. As for the driver..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "He's dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "This accursed place..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "text": "Lieutenant, wh-what is this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "text": "How can the city's defense artillery do this...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "Londinium's wall defenses were built almost seventy years ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "This is the first time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "Their cannons have been aimed... inside the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Not too shabby."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Even 10% of its firepower is enough to melt ordinary structures."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "text": "So this is Londinium's ultimate defense."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "That was only an auxiliary cannon."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Our weapon experts have said the main guns are able to easily penetrate the armor of any high-speed warship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "text": "A weapon expert...? Are you talking about the officer from the defense forces' engineering team?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "I must thank you for capturing his wife and daughter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "text": "Is he still alive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "As long as he is of use to the Sarkaz, he will not die."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Artilleryman, target Lift 11."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "The shot went wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Unfortunate. We'll have to improve our accuracy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "text": "These cannons were meant to point outwards, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Outwards... Before we entered Londinium, the defensive artillery was aimed at the ducal army outside the walls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "When we entered the city under the guise of quelling the dukes' conflicts, they never even once thought to put us in their sights––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Does that count as pointing outward?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "text": "Since the fall of Gaul and the silence of Iberia, a long time has passed without Victoria facing any real external threat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Indeed, which is why His Majesty found this opportunity for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Such sophisticated weaponry should be put to greater use, rather than sitting here as ornaments adorning the doorway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Artilleryman, activate dynamic target tracking."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Very good, it's working."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "We had to spend nearly a whole month to calibrate them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Luckily, they seem to be working well enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "These weapons put us in control of everything that enters and exits Londinium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Once all our cannons are in place... There will be nowhere to hide under the shadow of these steel walls."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "Dublinn seems to be drawing away the artillery fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "Is this... a test run? Is their purpose really just to calibrate..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "No, they're ultimately unconcerned with this port."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "text": "Lieutenant, what do we do now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "Continue to withdraw towards the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "However... the rest of Sudean is no longer safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "The Sarkaz are tightening their grip on Londinium. As long as the city's artillery is pointed inwards, our lives are in their hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "Unless..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_413_1",
      "text": "What's your plan, Lieutenant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "text": "It's nothing. Let's go, we'll talk after we've made our escape."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "These bloody walls! These bloody cannons!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "text": "Captain, your constructs got destroyed again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "I don't... have time for this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Don't just stand there staring! Away with you! Get out of here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Forcing us to run, eh? Mark my words, Manfred, you insult me like this today, I swear I'll..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "text": "Captain, that one I just saw running off that way... looked rather familiar..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "The Lupo brunette? Is it her?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Get her——\nUgh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "text": "Be careful, Captain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "What have you done?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dublinn Soldier",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "text": "I'm... protecting you... run! You still have to... find... for the Leader..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "Fine... fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "You're the thirteenth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mandragora",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "text": "The thirteenth Taran life. I will mark you down in the Leader's place. One day, I will personally make the Sarkaz pay for each and every life."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "General, we've routed Dublinn's team."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "I saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "But we couldn't find the rebels... Those sly insects! They peeked their heads out for a moment, but they vanished again after we activated the cannons."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "Uhh, could they have been killed already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "I... I don't think our job would be that easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "I'm glad you understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "Then, did they blend into the crowd? Should we notify the patrol so they can detain the civilians and continue the search?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "No need."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Continue to bombard the port. Oh, and increase the firepower."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Warrior",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_419_1",
      "text": "Increase the firepower? The port is almost completely destroyed. I can't imagine anyone would be hiding there still."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "They won't ever take this route again. Besides, have you ever seen a Sarkaz draw only half his sword?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Now that we've begun, why not let them see exactly what we're capable of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "text": "You're putting on a show of force for them. You want... to cut off their escape and force them to come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "This game of hide-and-seek has gone on long enough. Even if I don't mind waiting, the same cannot be said for His Majesty and the Royal Court."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Manfred",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "text": "Doesn't matter who it is. If they have a plan, I'd like them to hurry up with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "Doctor, we don't have anywhere safe to hide!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "Even if we all took cover under the structure, we'd still be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "...Vulnerable to their artillery blowing us to bits!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "I've done some rough calculations. If those cannons are fully charged, they'd be able to shoot clean through a standard city plate! This flimsy sheet plate above our heads on the wall there won't stand a chance!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "Siege, Londinium's cannons here are serious business!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "This is the first time I've seen them fired off on such a scale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "That means they're rolling out the red carpet for us, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "If that were the idea, we would be wiped out fifty kilometers outside the walls."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "Urgh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "Ahhh, I can't take it anymore––!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
      "text": "Amiya, my drones can't reinforce these plates any further. At this rate, we're going to get blasted sky-high!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "We need to get out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "Dublinn also scrambled to get away as fast as they could... but they used Arts constructs to defend themselves and left their wounded behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "Ugh... Argh, why's our luck so rotten...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Londinium Citizen",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "Are we going to die here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "We won't leave a single Londinier behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "Scout team, have you located the artillerymen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "Not yet...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "I'm afraid we can't find them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
      "text": "Londinium's urban defense cannons, and this wall looming in front of us, have always been a single entity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "text": "In other words... we have no way of stopping the barrage if we can't scale the wall or get inside it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Nobody can scale a wall under fire.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "We couldn't find a way inside.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "We can't just hide here waiting to die either!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "Why don't I run out there and try to draw their fire? With my skills, I should be able to buy a few minutes..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "Not happening."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
          "text": "If you're not letting her do it alone, then let's all go."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "Settle down, you two. Dagda, have you been hanging around Indra for so long that your brain turned to muscle?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dagda",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_396_1",
          "text": "Hey..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "If it was as easy as getting some live bait out there, would the two of you still be here making a scene?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "Our armor could maybe take two hits from a standard crossbow. Our friends in Engineering spent months working hard to make it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Morgan",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_405_1",
          "text": "If you're going to run out there and get yourself killed, you never should've come to Londinium in the first place!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "Alright, I get it. But I swear, I'm not letting anything happen to Vina!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Indra",
          "speakerId": "avg_155_tiger_1",
          "text": "We... haven't even been home yet!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "True, there's no point in running out there.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "It's too early to be saying that kind of stuff.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "Doctor, do you have a plan?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "The drones.",
