        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
          "text": "Drones, launching!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Run, everyone! Go, go!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Did it work?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "It bought us just enough time to move to a structure a few steps away... but this place won't last long either."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
          "text": "That was our one shot, too... My precious drones have all been reduced to scrap, and even I can't just conjure up another batch."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "We can't safely move forward or retreat backwards. If we want to escape the cannon fire, we're going to have to take some risks."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "I wish there were some way around all of this..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "I heard you needed a guide?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "Who's there?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Miss Cautus, I'd like to talk to you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "But before that, I'd appreciate it if you could have your people lower their weapons."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "You–– Who are you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Let's save the introductions for later."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Claws, a machete, and this... Uhh, this hammer? Ma'am, your weapon looks plenty brilliant, but I'd appreciate it if you could keep it away from my head."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Siege",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_407_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Otherwise, this friend of yours might be in danger."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "––Doctor!!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
