          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "All hands, weapons down."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "There we go, that's nice. Oh, make sure you get the message to your snipers around the corner too. I bet they haven't blinked once since I showed up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Do as he says."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Lovely."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "––Sir."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "I hope you believe us when we say that we'd never move to harm a stranger unprovoked, but––"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
          "text": "Harm one thread on the Doctor's hood and I promise you, right here, right now, I don't need a weapon to ensure you never threaten another human being."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Ahem..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Closure",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_411_1",
          "text": "Ugh... This place is already dangerous enough. Are we seriously going to get blown up before we even start our mission?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Right, if we don't want the Sarkaz to turn us to dust, we don't have time to be pointing weapons at each others' heads."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
          "text": "Listen up, I have an idea. Please come with me, nice and easy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_402_1",
